{"id": "77542a5c-e92c-4e32-9309-7d439a809536", "slug": "autonomous-infrastructure-command", "title": "Autonomous Infrastructure Command", "description": "Autonomous Infrastructure Content Section is designed for structuring a full-width content block for landing pages. Key features include reusable layout structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready styling. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-top-creators-featured\"\nname: \"Autonomous Infrastructure Command\"\ndescription: \"Autonomous Infrastructure Content Section is designed for structuring a full-width content block for landing pages. Key features include reusable layout structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready styling. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#FF4500\"\n  secondary: \"#FAFAFA\"\n  accent: \"#FF4500\"\n  background: \"#050505\"\n  surface: \"#A1A1AA\"\n  text-primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-secondary: \"#A1A1AA\"\n  border: \"#A1A1AA\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter Tight\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"8px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Autonomous Infrastructure Command\nSource: Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Samnang Aing (@samnang). Views: 8; favorites: 4; remixes: 0.\nTags: section, css, layout, content, responsive.\n## Overview\nAutonomous Infrastructure Content Section is designed for structuring a full-width content block for landing pages. Key features include reusable layout structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready styling. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\n\nAetherial Logic Core Network Orchestration Telemetry Sys.Online Initialize SEC_01 // CMD Protocol Engaged Autonomous Infrastructure Command Parse multi-node events, evaluate structural integrity in microseconds, and tri…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Autonomous Infrastructure Command; Live Telemetry.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #FF4500, secondary #FAFAFA, accent #FF4500, background #050505, surface #A1A1AA, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Inter Tight for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nCards, buttons, badges, navigation, and repeated blocks should preserve the source geometry, border treatment, and hover feel.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Autonomous Infrastructure Command</title>\n\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/ScrollTrigger.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/three.js/r128/three.min.js\"></script>\n\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400&family=Inter+Tight:wght@300;400&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@300;400&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-[#050505] text-[#FAFAFA] overflow-x-hidden min-h-screen relative selection:bg-[#FF4500] selection:text-white antialiased\" style=\"font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;\">\n\n    <!-- Background Layer: WebGL Globe & Fade -->\n    <div id=\"webgl-container\" class=\"fixed inset-0 z-0 pointer-events-none opacity-60 flex items-center justify-center\"></div>\n    <div class=\"fixed inset-x-0 bottom-0 h-1/2 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#050505] via-[#050505]/80 to-transparent pointer-events-none z-0\"></div>\n\n    <!-- Fixed Navigation -->\n    <nav class=\"fixed top-0 w-full z-50 px-6 lg:px-16 pt-8 pb-4 bg-[#050505]/50 backdrop-blur-md border-b border-white/5\">\n        <div class=\"max-w-[100rem] mx-auto flex flex-col md:flex-row items-start md:items-center justify-between gap-6\">\n\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\">\n                <div class=\"w-8 h-8 flex items-center justify-center border border-white/10\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:command-linear\" class=\"text-[#FF4500] text-xl\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"flex flex-col\">\n                    <span class=\"text-xl font-light tracking-tighter text-[#FAFAFA] leading-none uppercase\" style=\"font-family: 'Inter Tight', sans-serif;\">Aetherial</span>\n                    <span class=\"text-xs text-zinc-500 uppercase tracking-[0.2em] mt-1\" style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">Logic Core</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"hidden lg:flex items-center gap-12\" style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-xs text-zinc-500 uppercase tracking-[0.2em] hover:text-[#FAFAFA] transition-colors relative group\">\n                    Network\n                    <span class=\"absolute -bottom-2 left-0 w-0 h-[1px] bg-[#FF4500] group-hover:w-full transition-all duration-300\"></span>\n                </a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-xs text-[#FAFAFA] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] relative\">\n                    Orchestration\n                    <span class=\"absolute -bottom-2 left-0 w-full h-[1px] bg-[#FF4500]\"></span>\n                </a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-xs text-zinc-500 uppercase tracking-[0.2em] hover:text-[#FAFAFA] transition-colors relative group\">\n                    Telemetry\n                    <span class=\"absolute -bottom-2 left-0 w-0 h-[1px] bg-[#FF4500] group-hover:w-full transition-all duration-300\"></span>\n                </a>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-6\">\n                <span class=\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-zinc-500 uppercase tracking-[0.2em]\" style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">\n                    <span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-[#FF4500] rounded-full animate-pulse\"></span>\n                    Sys.Online\n                </span>\n\n                <!-- Gradient Border CTA -->\n                <div class=\"p-[1px] bg-gradient-to-br from-white/20 via-white/5 to-transparent rounded-none inline-block group\">\n                    <button class=\"bg-[#050505] text-[#FAFAFA] px-6 py-2 flex items-center gap-3 transition-all group-hover:bg-[#0a0a0a]\">\n                        <span class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em]\" style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">Initialize</span>\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:alt-arrow-right-linear\" class=\"text-[#FF4500] group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </button>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </nav>\n\n    <!-- Main Content Layout -->\n    <main class=\"relative z-10 w-full max-w-[100rem] mx-auto px-6 lg:px-16 flex flex-col mt-40 pb-32\">\n\n        <!-- Section 01: Hero -->\n        <div class=\"flex flex-col xl:flex-row gap-16 items-start relative min-h-[60vh]\">\n\n            <!-- Number Detail -->\n            <div class=\"absolute -left-2 top-0 text-zinc-800 text-xs tracking-[0.2em] origin-top-left -rotate-90 hidden lg:block\" style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">\n                SEC_01 // CMD\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Left: Headline Scale -->\n            <div class=\"xl:w-2/3 flex flex-col justify-center items-start text-left w-full z-10 pt-8\">\n                <div class=\"mb-10 flex items-center gap-3 border border-white/10 bg-[#0a0a0a]/80 backdrop-blur-sm px-4 py-2\">\n                    <div class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-[#FF4500]\"></div>\n                    <span class=\"text-xs text-zinc-400 uppercase tracking-[0.2em]\" style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">Protocol Engaged</span>\n                </div>\n\n                <h1 class=\"flex flex-col items-start w-full uppercase\" style=\"font-family: 'Inter Tight', sans-serif; line-height: 0.85;\">\n                    <div style=\"overflow: hidden;\" class=\"mb-3\">\n                        <div class=\"reveal-text text-5xl md:text-7xl lg:text-[7rem] font-light tracking-tighter text-[#FAFAFA]\" style=\"transform: translateY(100%);\">\n                            Autonomous\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div style=\"overflow: hidden;\" class=\"mb-3\">\n                        <div class=\"reveal-text text-5xl md:text-7xl lg:text-[7rem] font-light tracking-tighter text-zinc-500\" style=\"transform: translateY(100%);\">\n                            Infrastructure\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div style=\"overflow: hidden;\">\n                        <div class=\"reveal-text text-5xl md:text-7xl lg:text-[7rem] font-light tracking-tighter text-[#FAFAFA] flex items-center gap-6\" style=\"transform: translateY(100%);\">\n                            <span class=\"w-16 md:w-32 h-[2px] bg-[#FF4500] block mt-4\"></span>\n                            Command\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </h1>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Right: Copy & Actions -->\n            <div class=\"xl:w-1/3 flex flex-col items-start text-left xl:pt-32 xl:pl-12 border-t xl:border-t-0 xl:border-l border-white/10 z-10 relative\">\n\n                <p class=\"text-sm md:text-base text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed max-w-md mb-12 font-light\">\n                    Parse multi-node events, evaluate structural integrity in microseconds, and trigger systemic remediation without human input or latency overhead.\n                </p>\n\n                <div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-6 w-full sm:w-auto\">\n                    <!-- Primary Angular Action -->\n                    <button class=\"bg-[#FF4500] text-white px-8 py-4 text-xs tracking-[0.2em] transition-all hover:bg-[#FAFAFA] hover:text-[#050505] flex items-center justify-center gap-3 uppercase\" style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">\n                        Deploy Matrix\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:bolt-linear\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" class=\"text-lg\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </button>\n\n                    <button class=\"bg-transparent border border-white/20 text-zinc-300 px-8 py-4 text-xs tracking-[0.2em] transition-all hover:border-white/60 hover:text-white flex items-center justify-center gap-3 uppercase group\" style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">\n                        Inspect Logic\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-up-linear\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" class=\"text-lg group-hover:translate-x-1 group-hover:-translate-y-1 transition-transform\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </button>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Section 02: Telemetry Grid -->\n        <div class=\"mt-40 relative z-10 w-full pt-16 border-t border-white/10\">\n\n            <div class=\"absolute -left-2 top-16 text-zinc-800 text-xs tracking-[0.2em] origin-top-left -rotate-90 hidden lg:block\" style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">\n                SEC_02 // TLM\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Header -->\n            <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-end mb-8 gap-4\">\n                <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2\">\n                    <span class=\"text-xs text-zinc-500 uppercase tracking-[0.2em]\" style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">System Yield</span>\n                    <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-light tracking-tighter uppercase\" style=\"font-family: 'Inter Tight', sans-serif;\">Live Telemetry</h2>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"flex gap-2\">\n                    <div class=\"w-2 h-2 bg-zinc-700\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"w-2 h-2 bg-[#FF4500]\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"w-2 h-2 bg-zinc-700\"></div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Matte Gradient-Border Matrix Container -->\n            <div class=\"p-[1px] bg-gradient-to-b from-white/10 to-transparent w-full\">\n                <div class=\"bg-[#0a0a0a] grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 divide-y md:divide-y-0 md:divide-x divide-white/5\">\n\n                    <!-- Metric Block -->\n                    <div class=\"p-8 flex flex-col justify-between min-h-[160px] group relative hover:bg-white/[0.02] transition-colors\">\n                        <div class=\"flex justify-between items-start mb-8\">\n                            <span class=\"text-xs text-zinc-500 uppercase tracking-[0.2em]\" style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">Ingest Rate</span>\n                            <div class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-zinc-800 group-hover:bg-[#FF4500] transition-colors\"></div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"flex items-end justify-between\">\n                            <div class=\"text-4xl md:text-5xl font-light tracking-tighter text-[#FAFAFA]\" style=\"font-family: 'Inter Tight', sans-serif;\">4.8<span class=\"text-xl text-zinc-600\">M/s</span></div>\n                            <!-- Minimal Bar Graph -->\n                            <div class=\"flex gap-1 h-6 w-16 items-end opacity-50\">\n                                <div class=\"w-1/4 bg-zinc-700 h-1/3 group-hover:bg-[#FF4500] transition-colors\"></div>\n                                <div class=\"w-1/4 bg-zinc-700 h-2/3 group-hover:bg-[#FF4500] transition-colors delay-75\"></div>\n                                <div class=\"w-1/4 bg-zinc-700 h-1/2 group-hover:bg-[#FF4500] transition-colors delay-100\"></div>\n                                <div class=\"w-1/4 bg-white h-full\"></div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Metric Block -->\n                    <div class=\"p-8 flex flex-col justify-between min-h-[160px] group hover:bg-white/[0.02] transition-colors\">\n                        <div class=\"flex justify-between items-start mb-8\">\n                            <span class=\"text-xs text-zinc-500 uppercase tracking-[0.2em]\" style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">Compute Offset</span>\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:ruler-linear\" class=\"text-zinc-600 group-hover:text-[#FF4500] transition-colors\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                        </div>\n                        <div>\n                            <div class=\"text-4xl md:text-5xl font-light tracking-tighter text-[#FAFAFA] flex items-baseline gap-2\" style=\"font-family: 'Inter Tight', sans-serif;\">\n                                0.12 <span class=\"text-lg text-zinc-600 font-light\" style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">ms</span>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"text-xs text-[#FF4500] flex items-center gap-2 mt-3\" style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:graph-down-linear\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                                OPTIMAL BAND\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Metric Block -->\n                    <div class=\"p-8 flex flex-col justify-between min-h-[160px] group hover:bg-white/[0.02] transition-colors\">\n                        <div class=\"flex justify-between items-start mb-8\">\n                            <span class=\"text-xs text-zinc-500 uppercase tracking-[0.2em]\" style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">Deterministic SLA</span>\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:shield-check-linear\" class=\"text-zinc-600\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                        </div>\n                        <div>\n                            <div class=\"text-4xl md:text-5xl font-light tracking-tighter text-[#FAFAFA] mb-4\" style=\"font-family: 'Inter Tight', sans-serif;\">99.99<span class=\"text-2xl text-zinc-600\">%</span></div>\n                            <div class=\"w-full h-[2px] bg-zinc-900 relative\">\n                                <div class=\"absolute inset-y-0 left-0 bg-[#FF4500] w-[99.99%] shadow-[0_0_10px_rgba(255,69,0,0.5)]\"></div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Section 03: Visualization -->\n        <div class=\"mt-16 relative z-10 w-full pt-16 border-t border-white/10\">\n\n            <div class=\"absolute -left-2 top-16 text-zinc-800 text-xs tracking-[0.2em] origin-top-left -rotate-90 hidden lg:block\" style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">\n                SEC_03 // VIZ\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"p-[1px] bg-gradient-to-br from-white/10 via-transparent to-transparent\">\n                <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 divide-y lg:divide-y-0 lg:divide-x divide-white/5 bg-[#0a0a0a]\">\n\n                    <!-- Throughput Chart -->\n                    <div class=\"lg:col-span-2 p-8 flex flex-col relative overflow-hidden\">\n                        <div class=\"flex justify-between items-center mb-10 relative z-10\">\n                            <span class=\"text-sm text-zinc-300 font-light uppercase tracking-widest\">Network Topology</span>\n                            <span class=\"text-xs text-[#FF4500] border border-[#FF4500]/30 bg-[#FF4500]/10 px-3 py-1 uppercase tracking-[0.2em]\" style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">Routing Active</span>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <div class=\"flex-1 w-full relative min-h-[250px]\">\n                            <!-- Technical Grid -->\n                            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-[linear-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,0.03)_1px,transparent_1px),linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.03)_1px,transparent_1px)] bg-[size:40px_40px]\"></div>\n\n                            <!-- Engineered SVG Chart -->\n                            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 500 150\" class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\">\n                                <!-- Baseline -->\n                                <line x1=\"0\" y1=\"130\" x2=\"500\" y2=\"130\" stroke=\"#18181b\" stroke-width=\"1\" />\n\n                                <!-- Signal Line -->\n                                <path d=\"M0,110 L40,110 L80,40 L120,60 L160,50 L200,90 L240,30 L280,70 L320,50 L360,100 L400,20 L440,60 L500,40\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#52525b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linejoin=\"bevel\" />\n\n                                <!-- Active Orange Segment -->\n                                <path d=\"M200,90 L240,30 L280,70\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#FF4500\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linejoin=\"bevel\" />\n\n                                <!-- Data Nodes -->\n                                <rect x=\"77\" y=\"37\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" fill=\"#0a0a0a\" stroke=\"#a1a1aa\" stroke-width=\"1\" />\n                                <rect x=\"237\" y=\"27\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" fill=\"#0a0a0a\" stroke=\"#FF4500\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" />\n                                <rect x=\"397\" y=\"17\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" fill=\"#0a0a0a\" stroke=\"#a1a1aa\" stroke-width=\"1\" />\n\n                                <!-- Glow underneath active point -->\n                                <circle cx=\"240\" cy=\"30\" r=\"15\" fill=\"#FF4500\" opacity=\"0.15\" filter=\"blur(4px)\" />\n                            </svg>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Monospace Ledger -->\n                    <div class=\"p-8 flex flex-col h-full max-h-[400px] lg:max-h-none overflow-hidden bg-[#080808]\">\n                        <span class=\"text-sm text-zinc-300 font-light mb-8 block uppercase tracking-widest\">Execution Ledger</span>\n\n                        <div class=\"flex-1 overflow-y-auto pr-4 space-y-0 text-xs\" style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">\n\n                            <div class=\"flex flex-col py-3 border-b border-white/5 gap-2 group hover:bg-white/[0.02] px-2 -mx-2 transition-colors\">\n                                <div class=\"flex justify-between items-center text-zinc-500\">\n                                    <span>[ 00:00:14.2 ]</span>\n                                    <span class=\"text-zinc-400\">RCV</span>\n                                </div>\n                                <span class=\"text-zinc-300\">Auth payload verified via secondary cluster</span>\n                            </div>\n\n                            <div class=\"flex flex-col py-3 border-b border-white/5 gap-2 group hover:bg-white/[0.02] px-2 -mx-2 transition-colors\">\n                                <div class=\"flex justify-between items-center text-zinc-500\">\n                                    <span>[ 00:00:14.5 ]</span>\n                                    <span class=\"text-[#FF4500] border border-[#FF4500]/30 px-1 bg-[#FF4500]/10\">EXEC</span>\n                                </div>\n                                <span class=\"text-[#FAFAFA]\">Isolation sequence initiated on Node 7</span>\n                            </div>\n\n                            <div class=\"flex flex-col py-3 border-b border-white/5 gap-2 group hover:bg-white/[0.02] px-2 -mx-2 transition-colors\">\n                                <div class=\"flex justify-between items-center text-zinc-500\">\n                                    <span>[ 00:00:15.1 ]</span>\n                                    <span class=\"text-zinc-400\">SYNC</span>\n                                </div>\n                                <span class=\"text-zinc-300\">Topology maps updated across global state</span>\n                            </div>\n\n                            <div class=\"flex flex-col py-3 border-b border-white/5 gap-2 group hover:bg-white/[0.02] px-2 -mx-2 transition-colors\">\n                                <div class=\"flex justify-between items-center text-zinc-500\">\n                                    <span>[ 00:00:16.8 ]</span>\n                                    <span class=\"text-zinc-600\">IDLE</span>\n                                </div>\n                                <span class=\"text-zinc-500\">Subroutines suspended, awaiting command</span>\n                            </div>\n\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n    </main>\n\n    <script>\n        // Cinematic Typography Reveal\n        document.addEventListener(\"DOMContentLoaded\", () => {\n            gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);\n\n            // Masked upward word reveal with polished easing\n            gsap.to(\".reveal-text\", {\n                y: \"0%\",\n                duration: 1.6,\n                stagger: 0.15,\n                ease: \"power4.out\",\n                delay: 0.2\n            });\n        });\n\n        // WebGL Particle Globe (Responsive & Ambient)\n        const container = document.getElementById('webgl-container');\n        const scene = new THREE.Scene();\n\n        // Setup Camera\n        const camera = new THREE.PerspectiveCamera(45, window.innerWidth / window.innerHeight, 0.1, 1000);\n        camera.position.z = 12;\n        camera.position.x = 3; // Offset right so globe sits nicely behind left-aligned text\n\n        // Setup Renderer\n        const renderer = new THREE.WebGLRenderer({ alpha: true, antialias: true });\n        renderer.setSize(window.innerWidth, window.innerHeight);\n        renderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio, 2));\n        container.appendChild(renderer.domElement);\n\n        // Create Sphere Geometry mapping for particles\n        const geometry = new THREE.BufferGeometry();\n        const particlesCount = 4000;\n        const posArray = new Float32Array(particlesCount * 3);\n        const radius = 5;\n\n        for(let i = 0; i < particlesCount; i++) {\n            // Spherical distribution\n            const theta = Math.random() * Math.PI * 2;\n            const phi = Math.acos((Math.random() * 2) - 1);\n\n            // Add slight randomness to break perfect sphere for technical feel\n            const r = radius + (Math.random() * 0.5);\n\n            const x = r * Math.sin(phi) * Math.cos(theta);\n            const y = r * Math.sin(phi) * Math.sin(theta);\n            const z = r * Math.cos(phi);\n\n            posArray[i*3] = x;\n            posArray[i*3+1] = y;\n            posArray[i*3+2] = z;\n        }\n\n        geometry.setAttribute('position', new THREE.BufferAttribute(posArray, 3));\n\n        // Material with subtle coloring\n        const material = new THREE.PointsMaterial({\n            size: 0.02,\n            color: 0x71717a, // zinc-500\n            transparent: true,\n            opacity: 0.4,\n            blending: THREE.AdditiveBlending\n        });\n\n        const particlesMesh = new THREE.Points(geometry, material);\n        scene.add(particlesMesh);\n\n        // Add a secondary accent mesh (fewer, orange particles)\n        const accentGeo = new THREE.BufferGeometry();\n        const accentCount = 100;\n        const accentPos = new Float32Array(accentCount * 3);\n        for(let i=0; i<accentCount; i++){\n            const t = Math.random() * Math.PI * 2;\n            const p = Math.acos((Math.random() * 2) - 1);\n            accentPos[i*3] = radius * Math.sin(p) * Math.cos(t);\n            accentPos[i*3+1] = radius * Math.sin(p) * Math.sin(t);\n            accentPos[i*3+2] = radius * Math.cos(p);\n        }\n        accentGeo.setAttribute('position', new THREE.BufferAttribute(accentPos, 3));\n        const accentMat = new THREE.PointsMaterial({\n            size: 0.04,\n            color: 0xFF4500, // Signal Orange\n            transparent: true,\n            opacity: 0.8,\n            blending: THREE.AdditiveBlending\n        });\n        const accentMesh = new THREE.Points(accentGeo, accentMat);\n        scene.add(accentMesh);\n\n\n        // Mouse Interaction variables\n        let mouseX = 0;\n        let mouseY = 0;\n        let targetX = 0;\n        let targetY = 0;\n        const windowHalfX = window.innerWidth / 2;\n        const windowHalfY = window.innerHeight / 2;\n\n        document.addEventListener('mousemove', (event) => {\n            mouseX = (event.clientX - windowHalfX);\n            mouseY = (event.clientY - windowHalfY);\n        });\n\n        const clock = new THREE.Clock();\n\n        function animate() {\n            requestAnimationFrame(animate);\n            const elapsedTime = clock.getElapsedTime();\n\n            // Responsive Pointer Ripple / Sway\n            targetX = mouseX * 0.0005;\n            targetY = mouseY * 0.0005;\n\n            particlesMesh.rotation.y += 0.05 * (targetX - particlesMesh.rotation.y) + 0.001; // Base slow rotation + mouse\n            particlesMesh.rotation.x += 0.05 * (targetY - particlesMesh.rotation.x);\n\n            accentMesh.rotation.y = particlesMesh.rotation.y * 1.1; // Rotate slightly faster for depth\n            accentMesh.rotation.x = particlesMesh.rotation.x * 1.1;\n\n            renderer.render(scene, camera);\n        }\n\n        animate();\n\n        // Responsive handling\n        window.addEventListener('resize', () => {\n            camera.aspect = window.innerWidth / window.innerHeight;\n            camera.updateProjectionMatrix();\n            renderer.setSize(window.innerWidth, window.innerHeight);\n        });\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "autonomous-infrastructure-command.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/autonomous-infrastructure-command.jpg", "source_name": "autonomous-infrastructure-command-DESIGN.md", "views": 81, "forks": 3, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "66a84ecf-0972-40f3-8a4c-15b11d3aee0a", "created_at": "2026-05-01T16:18:09.070118+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-06-29T18:12:35.347306+00:00"}